{
  "slug": "cognito",
  "name": "Cognito",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A memory layer for Claude Code",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 agent** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `diary` (Claude's personal diary for process observations, working patterns, and meta-insights that don't fit in any wing room), `lint` (Audit and maintain vault health), `recall` (Search and retrieve knowledge from the memory vault), `remember` (Persist knowledge to the memory vault), `status` (Show vault status, statistics, and health overview), `wake` (Load persistent memory context at session start)\n- **Agents** (1): `memory-agent` (Background subagent for vault maintenance)\n- **Hooks** (2): `Stop`, `PreCompact`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cognito@claude-community` from `herrhelms/cognito-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 2
  },
